.&#10;Restrict access and protect secrets." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff5e6;strokeColor=#b77932;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="625" width="345" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="risk4" value="Denial of service&#10;Service disruption is hypothetical.&#10;Apply rate limits and resource controls." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff5e6;strokeColor=#b77932;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="405" y="625" width="345" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="risk5" value="Elevation of privilege&#10;Root password login permitted by configuration; escalation not tested.&#10;Restrict root access and update dependencies." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#fff5e6;strokeColor=#b77932;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="770" y="625" width="345" height="125" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>